WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.518
Lesson 6: Reading charts and exhibits

2
00:00:03.668 --> 00:00:10.373
Exhibits are where cases are won or lost. A five-step routine for turning any chart into an insight.

3
00:00:10.623 --> 00:00:12.096
Three things to remember.

4
00:00:12.116 --> 00:00:16.031
Title, axes and units, legend, footnote, every time.

5
00:00:16.231 --> 00:00:18.712
Lead with the insight, not a description.

6
00:00:18.912 --> 00:00:22.243
Quantify it, link it to the goal, say where you’d go next.

7
00:00:22.443 --> 00:00:27.182
The full lesson has a worked example, an exercise, and a quick quiz.
